# Opinion

Meeting: 0012-enhance-web-client-quality-and-coverage
Agent: Critic
Task: enhance web client quality and coverage
Context:
- Storage parsing lacks defensive behavior; untested branches could mask failures.
- UI templates need proof they render info states and empty lists safely.
Position:
- Demand explicit warnings and resets when storage data is corrupt.
- Require tests that fail fast on bad range inputs and confirm empty/info UI text remains present.
Recommendations:
- Harden createBrowserStorage load path and assert it in tests.
- Keep deterministic color/insight behavior under test while avoiding new dependencies.
